# Used by `pnpm build`. Vite compiles this value into the bundle, so rebuild and
# redeploy after changing it. Nothing here is secret: everything a VITE_-prefixed
# variable holds ships to the browser.
#
# The API has its own domain, so this is absolute. Coolify passes the same
# variable as a build variable, which takes priority over this file — this is
# the default for a plain `pnpm build` or `docker build`.
#
# The browser calls across origins, so the API's CORS_ORIGINS must list the
# origins the app is served from (apex and www).
VITE_API_URL=https://api.howtobac.ro/v1
